WEBVTT

00:00:29.390 --> 00:00:39.390
Project coordinator and song translator: Nemie

00:00:39.490 --> 00:00:49.490
Translators: Nemie, tamaramin, Kaia

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:43.330
I am very grateful for your sincerity

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:48.930
Your Majesty, have you seen what kind of heart your brother has?

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:51.990
How can I be away from a brother like him?

00:00:49.590 --> 00:00:59.590
Beta Editor: Sana

00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:57.010
Please cancel your order
and don't send him to Shinzhu

00:00:59.690 --> 00:01:09.690
Typesetters: Nemie, Sana

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.570
The water for tea has run out.
I'll go and get more

00:01:29.570 --> 00:01:33.640
I'll be gone for a while

00:02:26.070 --> 00:02:28.940
Yong Hwa, did you want to say something?

00:02:32.630 --> 00:02:34.920
Oh yes, I...

00:02:45.820 --> 00:02:48.450
I have an important request to ask, Your Majesty.

00:02:50.630 --> 00:02:55.030
It concerns my brother Uka

00:03:51.700 --> 00:03:53.170
Your Highness!

00:03:54.370 --> 00:03:56.790
Your... Your Highness!

00:03:57.400 --> 00:03:58.550
What's happened?!

00:03:58.550 --> 00:04:00.170
What's wrong with you, prince...

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:01.660
Help!

00:04:01.660 --> 00:04:04.450
Is there anyone?! Help!

00:04:04.450 --> 00:04:05.770
Your Highness!

00:04:05.770 --> 00:04:08.380
Hush... hush

00:04:08.380 --> 00:04:09.890
What?

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:12.910
You shouldn't be here, rather...

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:16.430
Prince, prince!

00:04:17.080 --> 00:04:20.170
Is there anyone? Help!

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:25.440
Following the example of my 4th brother, I also wanted to drink three cups

00:04:25.440 --> 00:04:28.350
Then I can ask you for a favor

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:30.790
Episode 11

00:04:30.360 --> 00:04:32.000
What kind of service?

00:04:33.110 --> 00:04:34.890
I'm already afraid

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:40.040
I don't know what to expect either

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:45.000
She and her brother are very close, I'm sure
what kind of brother would she ask for?

00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:03.180
Your Majesty

00:05:03.180 --> 00:05:07.020
A lot of time has passed since my brother was widowed

00:05:08.030 --> 00:05:12.280
Please allow him to remarry

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:14.300
Yong Hwa!

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:18.340
What do you think, Uk?

00:05:29.810 --> 00:05:34.840
If you let me
I have someone in mind

00:05:34.840 --> 00:05:37.140
There's no reason to disagree with you

00:05:37.140 --> 00:05:38.510
I'll let you

00:05:38.510 --> 00:05:40.230
Thank you for your mercy

00:05:50.670 --> 00:05:53.940
Your Majesty, my next request...

00:05:57.740 --> 00:05:58.840
Next...

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:01.720
About...

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:04.980
Yong Hwa!

00:06:04.980 --> 00:06:07.830
Yong Hwa! Yong Hwa!

00:06:09.140 --> 00:06:10.290
Sister!

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:12.770
Yong Hwa!

00:06:16.210 --> 00:06:17.490
Poison

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:22.280
I'm sure she drank poison.
Bring the doctor, quickly!

00:06:22.280 --> 00:06:25.150
What about So? Brother So...

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:30.750
Yong Hwa!

00:06:30.750 --> 00:06:32.040
Yong Hwa!

00:06:33.420 --> 00:06:35.360
Quickly take the princess away. Quicker!

00:06:35.360 --> 00:06:37.490
Yong Hwa. Yong Hwa!

00:06:38.310 --> 00:06:42.430
Why isn't anyone coming?! Is there really no one?!

00:06:45.990 --> 00:06:47.260
Brother!

00:06:48.560 --> 00:06:52.010
He vomited blood and is unconscious. What's wrong with him?

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:53.250
Poison

00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:54.320
Poison?

00:06:54.320 --> 00:06:56.490
- Help me quickly
- Okay

00:07:06.760 --> 00:07:08.310
The pulse is palpable

00:07:08.310 --> 00:07:11.270
Take the 4th prince to the healer. Fast!

00:07:11.270 --> 00:07:12.330
Eat!

00:07:19.610 --> 00:07:21.620
Brother! Brother!

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:27.970
It was she who brought chrysanthemum tea!

00:07:28.810 --> 00:07:29.970
Brother...

00:07:31.110 --> 00:07:33.870
Chi Mon, it's not her. Can't be!

00:07:33.870 --> 00:07:34.900
Grab it!

00:07:38.450 --> 00:07:42.080
Damiwon's Hae Soo is arrested for trying to kill the prince.

00:07:50.290 --> 00:07:52.220
Where is Nan Hee?

00:07:52.220 --> 00:07:55.100
Find out why Hae Soo brought tea instead of her

00:07:55.100 --> 00:07:58.690
We searched all over Damiwon and the palace, but did not find her.

00:08:15.690 --> 00:08:17.770
Minister, we found poison

00:08:18.740 --> 00:08:19.950
Of course

00:08:20.360 --> 00:08:23.190
And this precious necklace was here

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:24.790
Of course, the poison is here too

00:08:31.560 --> 00:08:34.290
How is she, the doctor? Why are you silent?

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:37.000
Don't worry

00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:41.700
Unlike the 4th Prince, Princess Yeon Hwa didn't drink that much.

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:44.960
She'll wake up when the antidote takes effect.

00:08:47.520 --> 00:08:48.920
You need to rest

00:08:50.870 --> 00:08:53.170
Keep an eye on her in case something goes wrong.

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:54.310
Okay, Your Highness

00:08:55.140 --> 00:08:56.500
Let's go, mother

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:10.800
Why are you surprised?

00:09:10.800 --> 00:09:16.360
I'm just overjoyed because you woke up

00:09:17.250 --> 00:09:20.330
But your facial expression says something else

00:09:21.310 --> 00:09:23.910
It's like they saw me pretend to drink poison

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:26.310
and then bit the cheek to draw blood

00:09:27.320 --> 00:09:28.650
How is this possible?

00:09:28.650 --> 00:09:29.740
Of course

00:09:30.340 --> 00:09:34.400
Who would have thought that the princess of this country would deliberately drink poison?

00:09:35.600 --> 00:09:38.260
So think about it carefully

00:09:40.440 --> 00:09:45.010
This is a palace where one wrong word can determine whether you die or live.

00:10:18.220 --> 00:10:21.180
This poison could not be recognized when tested

00:10:21.780 --> 00:10:24.370
Even one sip is enough
to put life at risk

00:10:25.430 --> 00:10:28.840
Okay, the general trained him like this,
that no poison will kill

00:10:30.720 --> 00:10:33.420
Why does this only happen to So?

00:10:34.220 --> 00:10:38.490
I'm always worried about him
and this time I actually thought that he would die

00:10:38.490 --> 00:10:40.550
He was meant for me

00:10:41.470 --> 00:10:44.700
I'm his big brother who always pushes him to certain death

00:10:45.630 --> 00:10:48.160
I have no right to look him in the eyes

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:50.670
He probably knew the tea was poisoned when he took his first sip.

00:10:50.670 --> 00:10:53.630
I can’t understand why he continued drinking

00:10:54.520 --> 00:10:56.910
Unless he was determined to die

00:10:56.910 --> 00:10:59.570
Come to think of it, a lot of things seemed strange

00:10:59.570 --> 00:11:02.420
He suddenly wanted to make a toast and drink three cups

00:11:02.420 --> 00:11:05.410
Knew he was poisoned, but left the feast

00:11:06.700 --> 00:11:09.390
I believe he knows who the criminal is

00:11:14.230 --> 00:11:19.700
He even sacrificed his life for him, who is this?

00:12:15.520 --> 00:12:18.070
Your Highness, what's wrong with Prince Seo?

00:12:25.920 --> 00:12:29.380
Nothing... bad happened?

00:12:29.380 --> 00:12:30.590
This can't happen

00:12:30.590 --> 00:12:32.850
He's not the type to die so easily, right?

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:35.800
So... okay

00:12:39.200 --> 00:12:42.570
His body resisted the poisoning,
he quickly drank the antidote

00:12:44.690 --> 00:12:45.780
He's alive

00:12:50.890 --> 00:12:52.580
You need to think about yourself

00:12:53.440 --> 00:12:55.850
You are suspected of poisoning the tea

00:12:55.850 --> 00:12:58.170
- No, I would never do that!
- I know

00:12:58.170 --> 00:13:00.360
But there is no proof of your innocence

00:13:05.590 --> 00:13:09.780
They... will demand to know the name of the instigator

00:13:12.690 --> 00:13:15.260
You may be tortured

00:13:16.400 --> 00:13:17.680
But still

00:13:19.150 --> 00:13:22.870
Still, Su, you must survive

00:13:24.150 --> 00:13:26.150
I'll get you out of here

00:13:27.250 --> 00:13:28.650
Don't give up

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:35.850
I won't let them use me to blame someone else

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:39.830
I'm ready for this, don't worry

00:13:47.360 --> 00:13:50.830
Are you saying that the crown prince tried to poison the 4th prince?

00:13:50.830 --> 00:13:55.120
Poison and a precious necklace were found in the room of court lady Hae Soo

00:13:55.120 --> 00:13:58.380
She was also spotted in Damiwon and the Crown Prince's residence.

00:13:58.380 --> 00:14:01.650
The witness said he saw them talking frequently with the crown prince.

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:04.060
Isn't there enough evidence?

00:14:05.430 --> 00:14:08.500
It is quite possible that he wanted to get the 4th prince out of the way,

00:14:08.500 --> 00:14:10.030
so that he doesn't take his place

00:14:10.030 --> 00:14:15.070
You accuse me of
that I tried to kill my brother?

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:21.080
After all my conspiracies
decided to spread rumors and blame me?

00:14:22.300 --> 00:14:24.010
Repeat again

00:14:24.010 --> 00:14:29.100
Tell me that I, Wang Mu, poisoned my brother,
to hold your position!

00:14:29.100 --> 00:14:31.900
For what reason did you give the necklace to the lady of the court?!

00:14:31.900 --> 00:14:34.640
You must reveal your secrets, Your Highness!

00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:37.010
It's disrespectful to the emperor, don't do it like that

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:45.180
The disease will worsen if you are nervous

00:14:53.270 --> 00:14:56.340
There were many eyes at the feast,
the probability of error was high

00:14:56.340 --> 00:14:57.740
How can you plan for poisoning?

00:14:58.680 --> 00:15:01.570
And you say that he gave the poison to the lady of the court,

00:15:01.570 --> 00:15:03.070
with whom I communicated well?

00:15:03.070 --> 00:15:06.240
Is this a plan to help a criminal escape punishment?

00:15:08.420 --> 00:15:10.860
It seems that the poison was intended for the crown prince,

00:15:10.860 --> 00:15:13.470
but mistakenly got to the 4th

00:15:14.280 --> 00:15:17.560
I'm sure Princess Yeon Hwa is poisoned too

00:15:17.560 --> 00:15:21.800
So you want to say that court lady He
tried to poison the crown prince?

00:15:25.580 --> 00:15:27.710
We can't confirm this

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:30.030
so don't make hasty conclusions

00:15:35.550 --> 00:15:36.990
Hae Soo

00:15:38.520 --> 00:15:41.850
will be hanged for trying to kill the prince

00:15:42.770 --> 00:15:45.200
She didn't do anything wrong

00:15:45.200 --> 00:15:47.890
Can anyone withstand torture?

00:15:47.890 --> 00:15:49.690
When false witnesses are found,

00:15:49.690 --> 00:15:51.470
you will be in danger, your highness

00:15:52.000 --> 00:15:54.830
I'm sure they are aware of your illness

00:15:54.830 --> 00:15:59.250
However, I can't let another person die because of me

00:16:01.030 --> 00:16:04.870
Just kick me out

00:16:04.870 --> 00:16:06.100
What nonsense!

00:16:06.100 --> 00:16:09.960
If you appoint a new crown prince, the nation and our family will be fine

00:16:15.170 --> 00:16:16.880
My good deeds are running out

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:22.280
Why do you insist that I have to do this?

00:16:22.280 --> 00:16:26.360
Mu... you are my first son

00:16:27.640 --> 00:16:29.740
Others are the sons of the emperor,

00:16:29.740 --> 00:16:31.730
but only you are the son of Wang Gon

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:35.780
We fought together

00:16:36.600 --> 00:16:39.200
We stood back to back, saving each other

00:16:39.200 --> 00:16:40.960
You are my son and comrade

00:16:43.860 --> 00:16:45.210
Therefore you

00:16:46.310 --> 00:16:48.950
I want to give everything

00:16:50.920 --> 00:16:53.340
Don't you understand my feelings?

00:17:09.780 --> 00:17:13.560
Brother, it will be worse if you move

00:17:15.540 --> 00:17:18.910
This girl... is alone

00:17:21.020 --> 00:17:22.110
Brother!

00:17:25.030 --> 00:17:27.320
Minister Park Young Gyu

00:17:27.320 --> 00:17:30.100
claims that Crown Prince Mu
used Hae Soo to poison you

00:17:30.620 --> 00:17:32.090
This is ridiculous

00:17:33.020 --> 00:17:34.190
Don't pay attention

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:37.040
I know it's ridiculous. Everyone knows!

00:17:38.440 --> 00:17:40.560
But there's no other way

00:17:45.070 --> 00:17:47.770
I shouldn't have let Hae Soo get mixed up with you

00:17:48.450 --> 00:17:50.020
This is what it all led to

00:17:54.100 --> 00:17:56.440
We need to talk in private

00:17:58.000 --> 00:17:59.740
- What?
- Fast!

00:18:07.650 --> 00:18:09.480
This is the empress

00:18:11.420 --> 00:18:12.670
My mother

00:18:16.490 --> 00:18:18.480
She said herself

00:18:19.340 --> 00:18:22.410
that they will bring poisoned tea to Prince Mu

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:26.900
Did you drink poison for your mother's benefit?

00:18:27.750 --> 00:18:29.880
Just like he killed murderers for her?

00:18:32.220 --> 00:18:35.870
I did this to save Hae Soo and the Crown Prince.

00:18:39.100 --> 00:18:40.230
Are you?

00:18:42.420 --> 00:18:43.550
Hae Soo?

00:18:43.550 --> 00:18:46.050
I tried to make sure no one knew about the poison

00:18:47.040 --> 00:18:49.450
Things got complicated when Yong Hwa drank it too

00:18:52.760 --> 00:18:55.330
I can't tell anyone that the poison was there in the first place

00:18:56.250 --> 00:18:58.380
My mother prepared everything well

00:19:00.920 --> 00:19:02.470
So, Uk, you

00:19:03.950 --> 00:19:05.770
must reveal the affairs of the empress

00:19:06.610 --> 00:19:08.900
No one will stand up for Hae Soo except you

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:11.850
Same thing with the crown prince

00:19:11.850 --> 00:19:16.590
I... will definitely find evidence

00:19:18.530 --> 00:19:20.960
I won't leave Su that easily

00:20:10.920 --> 00:20:12.410
As expected

00:20:13.710 --> 00:20:16.370
I knew you wouldn't die

00:20:17.980 --> 00:20:19.530
Of course

00:20:20.950 --> 00:20:22.510
This amount won't kill me

00:20:23.430 --> 00:20:25.870
Did you know he was poisoned

00:20:27.300 --> 00:20:29.880
They drank because they knew

00:20:29.880 --> 00:20:32.650
that I will be taken into custody?

00:20:32.650 --> 00:20:34.020
This is nonsense

00:20:35.870 --> 00:20:40.200
I'm not so pathetic that I'd drink poison because of a girl

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:45.990
Why did you do this?

00:20:47.430 --> 00:20:49.510
If you're so stubborn,

00:20:51.630 --> 00:20:54.480
Do you think my feelings will change?

00:21:00.180 --> 00:21:03.580
Who am I that you would risk your life for me?

00:21:03.940 --> 00:21:09.330
This will make it harder for me
turn away from you, your highness

00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:14.540
Just don't run away

00:21:16.180 --> 00:21:18.960
You really know how to create problems

00:21:21.930 --> 00:21:24.040
We both managed to survive and not die,

00:21:25.560 --> 00:21:27.220
I knew that we would meet again

00:21:29.010 --> 00:21:30.060
Lord

00:21:31.790 --> 00:21:34.540
I don't know what to do with you

00:21:36.220 --> 00:21:37.570
With you too

00:21:42.190 --> 00:21:46.720
Listen to the doctor, follow the treatment

00:21:46.720 --> 00:21:49.430
Don't hang around like that

00:21:49.960 --> 00:21:54.470
You shouldn't come here anymore, okay?

00:21:55.270 --> 00:21:56.700
Always teaching

00:22:45.730 --> 00:22:47.090
Thank you

00:22:54.380 --> 00:22:56.470
For... have mercy!

00:22:57.410 --> 00:22:59.920
If you give truthful testimony, you will live

00:23:01.850 --> 00:23:03.600
Why don't you go out?

00:23:04.220 --> 00:23:08.550
A member of the imperial family would allow a court lady to die like this?

00:23:13.100 --> 00:23:17.350
I already have a witness, there's no point in hiding

00:23:20.190 --> 00:23:22.770
Should I call the guards?

00:23:42.370 --> 00:23:44.870
Yes it's me

00:23:45.830 --> 00:23:46.940
Why are you...

00:23:47.980 --> 00:23:51.350
How come you're here?

00:23:51.350 --> 00:23:53.120
Is the reason important?

00:23:54.170 --> 00:23:58.030
Quickly tell the emperor
that I did this to save Su

00:24:04.180 --> 00:24:08.750
If your crime is discovered, we will become traitors

00:24:08.760 --> 00:24:09.850
Yes

00:24:09.850 --> 00:24:13.460
They'll hang me, they'll send my mother away

00:24:13.460 --> 00:24:15.400
Our home in Hwangju will turn into a desert

00:24:15.400 --> 00:24:18.190
Why?! Why did you do this?

00:24:18.190 --> 00:24:20.120
I wanted to talk some sense into you!

00:24:20.120 --> 00:24:24.300
You should rule this country, but you chose this girl!

00:24:24.300 --> 00:24:26.650
- I don't want to be an emperor!
- No!

00:24:26.650 --> 00:24:28.440
Do you want

00:24:32.160 --> 00:24:34.160
When you're alone

00:24:34.160 --> 00:24:36.730
what are your inner secret thoughts?

00:24:38.040 --> 00:24:41.510
What were you thinking when you looked at the 4th prince during the rain ritual?

00:24:42.510 --> 00:24:44.150
"This is my place"

00:24:44.150 --> 00:24:46.730
"These exclamations must be for me"

00:24:47.760 --> 00:24:49.940
I saw with my own eyes

00:24:51.600 --> 00:24:53.880
Do you want to be an emperor

00:24:55.270 --> 00:24:58.810
If you keep saying it's not true,
you can leave me and mom

00:24:59.450 --> 00:25:01.380
I won't be offended by you

00:25:01.380 --> 00:25:03.460
Still ready to die

00:25:23.780 --> 00:25:29.600
You knew well that I couldn’t leave you and mom

00:25:34.940 --> 00:25:36.620
From now on,

00:25:37.790 --> 00:25:38.820
Yong Hwa,

00:25:40.400 --> 00:25:42.670
you are not my sweet sister

00:25:48.290 --> 00:25:49.530
You're in debt

00:25:52.030 --> 00:25:55.090
You are for me and I am for you

00:25:57.970 --> 00:25:59.610
We owe each other

00:26:05.320 --> 00:26:06.370
This debt

00:26:07.530 --> 00:26:10.110
which I won't be able to repay for the rest of my life

00:26:11.670 --> 00:26:14.010
I will repay you with the throne

00:26:21.840 --> 00:26:23.040
You can do

00:26:25.750 --> 00:26:27.130
that's all with me

00:26:30.340 --> 00:26:31.620
whatever you want

00:28:10.200 --> 00:28:13.070
What should Su do?
even if you don't help her?

00:28:13.910 --> 00:28:15.530
Let's all go to the emperor together!

00:28:15.530 --> 00:28:18.430
If we ask for everything, swearing with our lives,
I'm sure he will give her life

00:28:21.210 --> 00:28:23.930
Stop hiding and come out

00:28:34.040 --> 00:28:35.750
Come out!

00:28:37.210 --> 00:28:39.250
Do you dare spy on princes?

00:28:39.760 --> 00:28:42.310
Is it true that Miss Su will die?

00:28:44.470 --> 00:28:46.360
Why does she have to die?

00:28:46.360 --> 00:28:48.940
Why will Mrs. Su die?

00:28:48.940 --> 00:28:52.750
Look at her. This shouldn't concern you at all.

00:28:52.750 --> 00:28:56.050
Go away. He said get out

00:28:58.100 --> 00:29:00.490
Your Highness, you won't let this happen

00:29:00.490 --> 00:29:01.780
Isn't that right?

00:29:01.780 --> 00:29:04.110
Please, Your Highness!

00:29:04.870 --> 00:29:06.200
I beg you, save her

00:29:08.510 --> 00:29:09.820
Please save her

00:29:10.660 --> 00:29:12.660
Your Highness, save her!

00:29:14.000 --> 00:29:18.290
Save her, your highness. I beg you!

00:29:18.840 --> 00:29:23.470
Please save me. Please, Your Highness!

00:29:37.150 --> 00:29:40.180
It doesn't matter what you do
the process cannot be stopped

00:29:40.720 --> 00:29:43.140
Her crime is too great

00:29:43.140 --> 00:29:45.230
You have always acted honestly, Your Majesty

00:29:45.230 --> 00:29:47.480
Why was the investigation conducted so badly this time?

00:29:48.610 --> 00:29:50.530
It's obvious to everyone that she's innocent

00:29:56.220 --> 00:30:00.370
You're not trying to use Hae Soo,
to save the crown prince?

00:30:01.640 --> 00:30:03.580
I'm trying to protect this country

00:30:04.410 --> 00:30:07.770
Using one insignificant life to save one important life

00:30:09.460 --> 00:30:11.020
Now I understand that being an emperor is

00:30:11.020 --> 00:30:13.970
it's throwing people around
and beg for everything for yourself

00:30:14.660 --> 00:30:15.790
You dare!

00:30:17.030 --> 00:30:19.070
Did you want death?

00:30:21.350 --> 00:30:24.420
I thought you were a well-sharpened sword

00:30:26.030 --> 00:30:27.910
I was wrong about you

00:30:27.910 --> 00:30:30.970
The owner must be able to
how to handle a sword

00:30:30.970 --> 00:30:33.080
If you come to me again, you will die

00:30:33.080 --> 00:30:36.030
Anyone who comes to ask for Hae Soo,
the same fate awaits!

00:30:36.030 --> 00:30:37.200
Your Majesty...

00:30:38.840 --> 00:30:39.960
Your Majesty!

00:31:23.220 --> 00:31:25.950
That's not why you're here
to drink tea

00:31:31.830 --> 00:31:36.690
Concubine Oh, you are the only one left
who can I ask

00:31:40.120 --> 00:31:41.630
Stand up for Hae Soo

00:31:42.950 --> 00:31:46.550
I'm sure you can change the emperor's mind

00:31:46.550 --> 00:31:51.850
I can't demand something like that
considering that we were once close

00:31:54.230 --> 00:31:56.920
It turns out you're going to ignore
is it until it's over?

00:31:57.640 --> 00:31:59.690
Will you let Hae Soo die?

00:32:03.020 --> 00:32:04.110
I know

00:32:04.850 --> 00:32:08.860
You are like a mother to her

00:32:12.470 --> 00:32:15.830
That's why you didn't like seeing her with me

00:32:18.300 --> 00:32:20.630
Why can't you stand up for her yourself?

00:32:22.040 --> 00:32:23.880
You said you loved her

00:32:24.420 --> 00:32:26.830
Even if you die
you should try to save Hae Soo

00:32:27.470 --> 00:32:29.690
It would be better if I stood up for her

00:32:31.270 --> 00:32:33.670
Are you being held back by the Queen and your family?

00:32:37.250 --> 00:32:40.130
I think this may have something to do with the transfer of the throne

00:32:42.990 --> 00:32:45.640
The reason why all the men in the imperial family become cowards is

00:32:45.640 --> 00:32:47.340
always the same

00:32:48.330 --> 00:32:49.590
Concubine O

00:32:49.590 --> 00:32:54.190
One day you will regret what a coward you were today

00:32:55.480 --> 00:33:00.530
You turned away from her once,
but it will torment you forever

00:33:04.370 --> 00:33:09.310
I will meet the emperor
because I'm really worried about Hae Soo

00:33:12.160 --> 00:33:16.310
You couldn't save anyone, Your Highness

00:34:23.510 --> 00:34:25.600
Say something

00:34:25.600 --> 00:34:28.110
Just don't talk about Hae Soo

00:34:28.110 --> 00:34:32.690
I... poisoned the crown prince

00:34:37.190 --> 00:34:39.010
I lost my child

00:34:39.600 --> 00:34:43.570
The prince grew up to be a healthy boy
and I was jealous of him because he would take the throne

00:34:44.690 --> 00:34:46.560
That's why I tried to kill the crown prince

00:34:46.560 --> 00:34:49.360
I told you not to try to save this girl

00:34:49.360 --> 00:34:51.790
Why did you turn against this innocent child?

00:34:53.170 --> 00:34:56.270
I confess to the crime I committed,
so let Hae Soo...

00:34:56.270 --> 00:34:57.770
I'll pretend I didn't hear this

00:35:23.750 --> 00:35:25.110
More than 10 years ago...

00:35:26.990 --> 00:35:30.320
one high-ranking person sent me quince tea

00:35:32.880 --> 00:35:35.090
This should have helped
with morning sickness

00:35:36.140 --> 00:35:38.380
That's why I drank it every day

00:35:40.400 --> 00:35:42.810
I drank as soon as I woke up

00:35:45.790 --> 00:35:48.210
Not even seven days have passed...

00:35:49.710 --> 00:35:51.530
how I lost my child, Your Majesty

00:35:56.990 --> 00:35:59.790
Because of a cup of tea sent by the same person,

00:35:59.790 --> 00:36:02.390
I can't lose the girl
who is like my own daughter

00:36:04.550 --> 00:36:06.790
Hae Soo is not your dead child

00:36:07.610 --> 00:36:10.680
Moreover, there is no evidence
that Empress Yu did it

00:36:13.540 --> 00:36:18.690
This time, are you also going to pretend that you don’t know anything?

00:36:29.120 --> 00:36:31.130
I'll die soon

00:36:33.020 --> 00:36:34.440
Soo Young

00:36:34.440 --> 00:36:37.840
Two days ago I discovered
that I can't digest food

00:36:37.840 --> 00:36:39.520
The nausea is back

00:36:40.710 --> 00:36:42.810
So I went to the doctor

00:36:46.120 --> 00:36:48.020
He said it was panvi*

00:36:46.650 --> 00:36:49.190
* Stomach cancer

00:36:50.840 --> 00:36:55.210
I know you're going to kill Hae Soo,
to protect the crown prince

00:36:56.920 --> 00:36:59.210
I know you can't save them both

00:37:01.680 --> 00:37:07.330
But I can't give my child to Empress Yu

00:37:08.640 --> 00:37:09.840
Please help me

00:37:15.770 --> 00:37:17.910
This is my last request

00:37:22.680 --> 00:37:23.980
You...

00:37:26.050 --> 00:37:28.580
finally giving up on me?

00:38:46.040 --> 00:38:49.030
Am I... going to die?

00:38:55.280 --> 00:38:56.670
Where is the 8th prince?

00:38:57.830 --> 00:38:58.980
Where are you?

00:38:58.980 --> 00:39:03.020
You must see me.
You must see me!

00:39:05.940 --> 00:39:07.020
Su!

00:39:12.210 --> 00:39:13.260
Away

00:39:28.240 --> 00:39:29.990
This child will come with me

00:39:37.680 --> 00:39:39.540
Does blood have to be shed for you to leave?

00:39:43.000 --> 00:39:45.670
Emperor's order! Emperor's order!

00:39:49.170 --> 00:39:52.360
The hanging is cancelled.
The real culprit has been found

00:39:54.650 --> 00:39:55.930
Su!

00:40:01.350 --> 00:40:02.990
Concubine O

00:40:34.610 --> 00:40:39.290
We have orders to arrest Concubine O
from Damiwon Palace for attempting to assassinate the prince

00:40:42.520 --> 00:40:46.160
I obey orders

00:40:46.160 --> 00:40:47.350
Concubine Oh!

00:40:49.310 --> 00:40:50.340
Su!

00:40:55.080 --> 00:40:57.020
What are they talking about?

00:40:57.020 --> 00:40:59.010
Murder of a prince? What are they talking about?

00:40:59.810 --> 00:41:03.480
I poisoned the crown prince's tea

00:41:08.630 --> 00:41:09.800
Lie

00:41:11.980 --> 00:41:14.420
I'm sorry I misled you

00:41:25.760 --> 00:41:26.770
Leave them

00:41:29.230 --> 00:41:30.520
Give them some time

00:41:48.460 --> 00:41:50.220
Can't get out

00:41:51.240 --> 00:41:52.820
Everything was blocked off

00:41:54.440 --> 00:41:56.000
We can open again

00:41:59.460 --> 00:42:01.030
You said we could go to your hometown

00:42:02.340 --> 00:42:03.560
Let's go right now

00:42:06.040 --> 00:42:10.610
If you said we need to go... I'll go anywhere

00:42:11.500 --> 00:42:13.070
Come on!

00:42:13.980 --> 00:42:16.460
I can't live like this anymore

00:42:21.740 --> 00:42:23.060
Enough is enough

00:42:23.590 --> 00:42:25.710
You just want to take the place of the one who did it?

00:42:26.390 --> 00:42:28.790
You are going to die in my place!

00:42:28.790 --> 00:42:32.020
But... But what should I do?

00:42:32.020 --> 00:42:33.990
How will I live?

00:42:36.160 --> 00:42:39.480
No. No, you can't do that

00:42:39.480 --> 00:42:40.760
We'll get out of here!

00:42:48.540 --> 00:42:50.060
It's not your fault

00:42:52.290 --> 00:42:54.440
I'm not doing this because of you

00:42:55.950 --> 00:42:58.050
I'm doing this to help the emperor.

00:43:01.460 --> 00:43:03.750
I don't have much time left

00:43:05.970 --> 00:43:10.530
You don't have to sympathize with me
or feel guilty

00:43:17.730 --> 00:43:18.920
Please

00:43:21.190 --> 00:43:22.870
Please...

00:43:23.800 --> 00:43:26.730
I'm fine

00:43:34.670 --> 00:43:38.630
And I protected what I wanted to protect

00:43:39.180 --> 00:43:41.220
Now it's time to pay for it

00:43:46.450 --> 00:43:47.970
I don't regret anything

00:43:50.780 --> 00:43:52.540
Be very careful

00:43:53.480 --> 00:43:56.020
Don't trust anyone

00:43:56.770 --> 00:44:01.000
Every day, every hour,
every time you take a step

00:44:01.000 --> 00:44:04.180
you have to be careful
it's like walking on thin ice

00:44:08.000 --> 00:44:12.110
You don't have to live the way I lived

00:44:13.310 --> 00:44:14.420
Okay?

00:45:12.040 --> 00:45:13.330
Your Majesty

00:45:14.900 --> 00:45:17.030
Please spare concubine O

00:45:18.760 --> 00:45:20.980
It's not her fault

00:45:22.890 --> 00:45:27.420
Your Majesty, please reconsider your decision

00:45:28.790 --> 00:45:31.140
Concubine O is innocent

00:45:32.360 --> 00:45:33.780
Your Highness

00:45:34.660 --> 00:45:36.990
Your Highness, let Concubine O live

00:45:38.220 --> 00:45:39.340
Go away

00:45:39.340 --> 00:45:41.850
There's nothing you can do to help her now.

00:45:44.010 --> 00:45:45.890
I can't leave her like this

00:45:48.140 --> 00:45:52.300
I never stopped you, but now you can't go

00:45:53.430 --> 00:45:56.350
If you want to do this, you'll have to step over me

00:45:56.350 --> 00:45:58.810
- Mom
- I must protect my child!

00:45:58.810 --> 00:46:01.970
You don't know how the emperor felt
when he decided to go against concubine O

00:46:02.530 --> 00:46:06.740
If you let yourself be drawn into this,
consider that you have sacrificed your life

00:46:06.740 --> 00:46:09.250
You've already given it up, brother.

00:46:09.840 --> 00:46:12.600
It's not like you can do it twice

00:46:15.640 --> 00:46:20.300
Yong Hwa, how much more do you want to owe me?

00:46:23.440 --> 00:46:25.530
What are you all doing here?

00:46:27.720 --> 00:46:31.580
I heard that He girl knelt down in protest

00:46:33.810 --> 00:46:36.110
You must be upset, Uk

00:46:36.110 --> 00:46:38.050
I know you cared about her

00:46:38.050 --> 00:46:40.140
This is a misunderstanding

00:46:40.140 --> 00:46:42.670
She was only his wife's cousin

00:46:42.670 --> 00:46:45.230
Hae Soo was falsely accused

00:46:46.390 --> 00:46:49.650
You must also believe
that concubine O is innocent

00:46:50.960 --> 00:46:52.740
And who is to blame then?

00:46:53.240 --> 00:46:55.720
The crown prince's family or something else?

00:46:56.540 --> 00:46:59.710
Perhaps you suspect me

00:46:59.710 --> 00:47:00.920
Empress Yu

00:47:01.620 --> 00:47:03.690
- Empress!
- Mother!

00:47:05.950 --> 00:47:08.210
Isn't it enough that you kicked me out?

00:47:08.210 --> 00:47:11.060
Please don't harm Wook or Yong Hwa

00:47:11.060 --> 00:47:13.700
I can't stand it if they have to go through what I went through.

00:47:13.700 --> 00:47:18.520
That's why I'm on my knees before you now

00:47:18.520 --> 00:47:21.600
Please...please!

00:47:24.990 --> 00:47:28.770
You should have paid more attention to raising your son

00:47:29.960 --> 00:47:32.960
What good is it to be born a prince with a golden spoon in his mouth?

00:47:32.960 --> 00:47:35.990
He must know who is the owner of the table at which he eats

00:47:40.270 --> 00:47:43.370
At this rate this girl is going to die.

00:47:44.060 --> 00:47:47.010
She should have died sooner
if you were going to do it anyway

00:47:47.010 --> 00:47:50.150
How can she bet life
another person along with yours?

00:47:51.840 --> 00:47:53.330
Rise up

00:47:53.330 --> 00:47:55.660
Think about how you exposed yourself to the servants

00:48:11.230 --> 00:48:12.470
Your Majesty

00:48:14.400 --> 00:48:16.810
Please spare concubine O

00:48:19.130 --> 00:48:21.320
It's not fair, Your Majesty

00:48:24.790 --> 00:48:26.130
Your Majesty

00:48:28.470 --> 00:48:29.790
Your Majesty

00:48:31.490 --> 00:48:33.300
Concubine O didn't do this

00:48:33.870 --> 00:48:35.120
Your Majesty

00:48:37.260 --> 00:48:39.900
Your Majesty, let Concubine O live

00:49:00.370 --> 00:49:01.660
Silly

00:49:05.720 --> 00:49:07.110
Your Highness

00:49:10.750 --> 00:49:13.790
Do you think the emperor will change his mind because of you?

00:49:15.630 --> 00:49:18.240
You are unwell. Let's go before you get worse

00:49:18.790 --> 00:49:20.610
Concubine O...

00:49:22.810 --> 00:49:26.930
She took the blame to save my life

00:49:26.930 --> 00:49:28.650
Everyone knows it

00:49:29.310 --> 00:49:32.510
However, there is nothing more terrible than the wrath of the emperor

00:49:32.510 --> 00:49:34.190
So no one can help you

00:49:36.050 --> 00:49:37.420
Now you have to give in

00:49:37.990 --> 00:49:43.250
I can't turn my back on the concubine like this

00:49:43.850 --> 00:49:45.820
Why are you so stubborn?

00:49:46.400 --> 00:49:48.560
Concubine O had a hard time saving you

00:49:49.590 --> 00:49:51.140
Are you going to give a damn about it?

00:49:52.290 --> 00:49:54.810
It's better

00:49:56.880 --> 00:49:58.440
rather than do nothing

00:50:02.340 --> 00:50:04.970
If you continue to be stubborn,
I can't help it

00:50:07.310 --> 00:50:08.740
Be patient as long as you can

00:50:10.770 --> 00:50:12.820
I'll prepare medicine for you

00:50:15.210 --> 00:50:16.530
Your Highness

00:50:17.800 --> 00:50:21.250
By any chance, have you seen the 8th Prince?

00:50:27.270 --> 00:50:28.410
Forget it

00:50:40.790 --> 00:50:45.020
Emperor, please, if you can, cancel the execution

00:50:45.750 --> 00:50:47.380
If you lose your concubine Oh like this,

00:50:47.380 --> 00:50:49.330
you will regret it

00:50:51.050 --> 00:50:54.040
Protecting the country and saving the crown prince is very important

00:50:54.040 --> 00:50:56.370
But if you get rid of everyone you care about,

00:50:56.370 --> 00:50:58.840
how can you live alone?

00:50:59.670 --> 00:51:01.880
This is the emperor's job

00:51:02.680 --> 00:51:04.770
You should throw things away when you can.

00:51:07.320 --> 00:51:08.550
Your Majesty

00:51:08.550 --> 00:51:10.580
Court Lady Hae Soo of Damiwon

00:51:10.580 --> 00:51:12.650
has been kneeling in protest for two days now

00:51:13.130 --> 00:51:16.350
Let him act of his own free will.
Don't go out to her

00:51:17.060 --> 00:51:20.370
If no one takes her side,
I won't consider her objections

00:53:50.130 --> 00:53:51.140
Why?

00:54:18.010 --> 00:54:20.290
When I see you I

00:54:21.790 --> 00:54:25.100
I can’t breathe, I’m timid

00:54:25.290 --> 00:54:28.890
It's as if everything in the world has stopped

00:54:31.190 --> 00:54:35.790
If I pass by like a breeze,

00:54:35.790 --> 00:54:38.890
you won't even notice

00:54:39.590 --> 00:54:44.190
My heart is all given to you

00:54:46.090 --> 00:54:52.190
But loving you is very painful for me

00:54:52.190 --> 00:54:54.390
And so sad

00:54:54.390 --> 00:54:58.890
I need to cross you out of my heart

00:55:00.190 --> 00:55:01.790
so hard

00:55:03.990 --> 00:55:08.090
Don't forget, please!

00:55:08.960 --> 00:55:13.390
That eternal love of mine

00:55:15.370 --> 00:55:21.470
But loving you is very painful for me

00:55:21.470 --> 00:55:23.670
And so sad

00:55:23.910 --> 00:55:28.770
I need to cross you out of my heart

00:55:29.710 --> 00:55:31.070
so hard

00:55:33.540 --> 00:55:36.820
I believe once upon a time

00:55:38.290 --> 00:55:41.620
how I want to love

00:55:43.660 --> 00:55:44.820
I can

00:55:52.970 --> 00:55:54.230
Stop

00:56:02.900 --> 00:56:05.890
I wanted to see your death with my own eyes

00:56:06.520 --> 00:56:08.450
My wish came true

00:56:09.750 --> 00:56:11.760
You lost to me

00:56:12.570 --> 00:56:14.780
Death is first and foremost a loss

00:56:18.960 --> 00:56:21.390
Your Majesty, you know very well

00:56:22.500 --> 00:56:25.340
You've never won against me

00:56:28.480 --> 00:56:31.710
Will you be as arrogant
when will they hang you by the throat?

00:56:34.020 --> 00:56:37.580
Please live long
and a good life, your majesty

00:56:38.690 --> 00:56:40.920
How lonely your life will be...

00:56:41.750 --> 00:56:44.130
Even from this world I will watch this

00:56:47.140 --> 00:56:48.440
As you please

00:56:50.940 --> 00:56:52.380
I am the empress

00:56:53.060 --> 00:56:57.080
And you are an unknown court lady,
whose name after your death no one will even remember

00:57:08.690 --> 00:57:12.840
It will be enough for me
if one person remembers me

00:57:37.140 --> 00:57:39.880
Concubine... concubine O

00:58:19.670 --> 00:58:20.970
Your Majesty

00:58:36.800 --> 00:58:38.050
Concubine O

00:58:39.490 --> 00:58:40.720
- Su!
- Concubine Oh!

00:58:40.720 --> 00:58:42.630
- Su, Su!
- Concubine Oh!

00:58:42.630 --> 00:58:45.710
Let me in! Concubine Oh, Concubine Oh!

00:58:46.360 --> 00:58:48.330
Concubine Oh!

00:58:48.830 --> 00:58:51.670
Concubine Oh! Let me go!

00:59:01.760 --> 00:59:05.040
If I knew
that someone would die for me...

00:59:06.560 --> 00:59:09.790
I wouldn't be so greedy
to wish for a new life

00:59:15.740 --> 00:59:17.940
I wish this was all a dream

00:59:19.810 --> 00:59:25.240
I really want to wake up
and forget everything that happened here

00:59:36.340 --> 00:59:43.390
Thanks for watching with us!
