00:59:43.390 --> 00:59:46.140
Scarlet Hearts: Ryeo

00:59:46.550 --> 00:59:47.660
Get rid of Hae Soo

00:59:47.660 --> 00:59:50.190
Send her to a place where she can't meet princes

00:59:50.190 --> 00:59:51.960
Is it normal for you to let her go like this?

00:59:51.960 --> 00:59:53.340
I can't risk my life for her

00:59:53.340 --> 00:59:55.360
Are you still fascinated by her?!

00:59:55.360 --> 00:59:57.110
I can't refuse her

00:59:57.110 --> 00:59:57.990
I missed you

00:59:58.710 --> 00:59:59.510
Let's get married

00:59:59.510 --> 01:00:00.690
Aren't you my man?

01:00:01.140 --> 01:00:02.910
Marriage between a prince and a washerwoman?

01:00:03.160 --> 01:00:05.040
I said I want to get married, so I'll get married

01:00:05.460 --> 01:00:07.360
Say that you will not attend the council

01:00:08.460 --> 01:00:10.410
- Your Majesty!
- Your Majesty!

01:00:10.790 --> 01:00:11.840
I will become an emperor

01:00:11.860 --> 01:00:13.190
I will be the emperor
